§ `Tests — sections 72 and 335`

§§ `Section 72`

GIVEN `arose`   IS A DATE
      `ended`   IS A `How the entitlement for the child ended`
      `lived`   IS A BOOLEAN
      `paid`    IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `An entitlement to the child allowance for a child, for section 72`
`an entitlement arising on` `arose` `, ending:` `ended` `, the child having lived seven days or left the hospital:` `lived` `, an allowance having been paid:` `paid` MEANS
    `An entitlement to the child allowance for a child, for section 72` WITH
        `the day the entitlement arose`                            IS `arose`
        `how it ended`                                             IS `ended`
        `the child lived at least seven days or left the hospital` IS `lived`
        `a child allowance was paid for the child`                 IS `paid`

-- (a): born on 10 June 2026, by the 15th: paid from 1 June. Not for May.
`born 10 June 2026` MEANS `an entitlement arising on` (YMD 2026 6 10) `, ending:` `it has not ended` `, the child having lived seven days or left the hospital:` TRUE `, an allowance having been paid:` TRUE
#ASSERT `s 72 — the allowance is paid for month` 6 `of` 2026 `, for` `born 10 June 2026`
#ASSERT `s 72 — the allowance is paid for month` 7 `of` 2026 `, for` `born 10 June 2026`
#ASSERT NOT `s 72 — the allowance is paid for month` 5 `of` 2026 `, for` `born 10 June 2026`
-- Born on the 15th: "עד 15" includes it (fork N1). Born on the 16th: from 1 July.
#ASSERT `s 72 — the allowance is paid for month` 6 `of` 2026 `, for` (`an entitlement arising on` (YMD 2026 6 15) `, ending:` `it has not ended` `, the child having lived seven days or left the hospital:` TRUE `, an allowance having been paid:` TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `s 72 — the allowance is paid for month` 6 `of` 2026 `, for` (`an entitlement arising on` (YMD 2026 6 16) `, ending:` `it has not ended` `, the child having lived seven days or left the hospital:` TRUE `, an allowance having been paid:` TRUE)
#ASSERT `s 72 — the allowance is paid for month` 7 `of` 2026 `, for` (`an entitlement arising on` (YMD 2026 6 16) `, ending:` `it has not ended` `, the child having lived seven days or left the hospital:` TRUE `, an allowance having been paid:` TRUE)

-- (a), last limb: a child born 20 March 2008 turns 18 on 20 March 2026, and entitlement ceases that
-- day (row IL-06: a "child" has not reached 18). Paid to the last day of March; not for April.
`turns 18 on 20 March 2026` MEANS `an entitlement arising on` (YMD 2008 3 20) `, ending:` (`it ceased, other than by the child's death, on` (YMD 2026 3 20)) `, the child having lived seven days or left the hospital:` TRUE `, an allowance having been paid:` TRUE
#ASSERT `s 72 — the allowance is paid for month` 3 `of` 2026 `, for` `turns 18 on 20 March 2026`
#ASSERT NOT `s 72 — the allowance is paid for month` 4 `of` 2026 `, for` `turns 18 on 20 March 2026`
-- Ceased on 1 August 2026: August paid, September not.
#ASSERT `s 72 — the allowance is paid for month` 8 `of` 2026 `, for` (`an entitlement arising on` (YMD 2020 1 1) `, ending:` (`it ceased, other than by the child's death, on` (YMD 2026 8 1)) `, the child having lived seven days or left the hospital:` TRUE `, an allowance having been paid:` TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `s 72 — the allowance is paid for month` 9 `of` 2026 `, for` (`an entitlement arising on` (YMD 2020 1 1) `, ending:` (`it ceased, other than by the child's death, on` (YMD 2026 8 1)) `, the child having lived seven days or left the hospital:` TRUE `, an allowance having been paid:` TRUE)

-- (c): a child for whom the allowance was paid died on 5 February 2026: paid for three months from the
-- end of February, so to the end of May; not for June.
`died 5 February 2026` MEANS `an entitlement arising on` (YMD 2020 1 1) `, ending:` (`the child died on` (YMD 2026 2 5)) `, the child having lived seven days or left the hospital:` TRUE `, an allowance having been paid:` TRUE
#ASSERT `s 72 — the allowance is paid for month` 2 `of` 2026 `, for` `died 5 February 2026`
#ASSERT `s 72 — the allowance is paid for month` 5 `of` 2026 `, for` `died 5 February 2026`
#ASSERT NOT `s 72 — the allowance is paid for month` 6 `of` 2026 `, for` `died 5 February 2026`
-- A child for whom no allowance had been paid: (c) does not reach it, and (a) ends payment with February.
#ASSERT NOT `s 72 — the allowance is paid for month` 3 `of` 2026 `, for` (`an entitlement arising on` (YMD 2026 1 1) `, ending:` (`the child died on` (YMD 2026 2 5)) `, the child having lived seven days or left the hospital:` TRUE `, an allowance having been paid:` FALSE)

-- (b): a child who lived fewer than seven days and did not leave the hospital: no allowance at all.
#ASSERT NOT `s 72 — the allowance is paid for month` 2 `of` 2026 `, for` (`an entitlement arising on` (YMD 2026 2 2) `, ending:` (`the child died on` (YMD 2026 2 5)) `, the child having lived seven days or left the hospital:` FALSE `, an allowance having been paid:` FALSE)

-- Before May 2015: declined.
#ASSERT REFUSED `s 72 — the allowance is paid for month` 4 `of` 2015 `, for` (`an entitlement arising on` (YMD 2010 1 1) `, ending:` `it has not ended` `, the child having lived seven days or left the hospital:` TRUE `, an allowance having been paid:` TRUE) BECAUSE "this row answers months of the child allowance from May 2015, the period row IL-06 answers"

§§ `Section 335`

-- Positionally, under this ruler (the order of the DECLARE in nii-il08-nouns.l4):
--  year | worker | resident | Ch 11 | housewife | widow pensioner | Ch 5 | Ch 6 | s 158(1) | controlling shareholder | Ch 8 employee | Ch 9 | long-term care
`a resident employee insured in every Chapter`          MEANS `A person in a contribution period, for section 335` OF 2026, TRUE,  TRUE,  TRUE,  FALSE, FALSE, TRUE,  TRUE,  TRUE,  FALSE, TRUE,  TRUE,  TRUE
`a controlling shareholder in a closely-held company`   MEANS `A person in a contribution period, for section 335` OF 2026, TRUE,  TRUE,  TRUE,  FALSE, FALSE, TRUE,  TRUE,  TRUE,  TRUE,  TRUE,  TRUE,  TRUE
`a non-resident employee insured under Chapter 5 only`  MEANS `A person in a contribution period, for section 335` OF 2026, TRUE,  FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE,  FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`a housewife`                                           MEANS `A person in a contribution period, for section 335` OF 2026, FALSE, TRUE,  TRUE,  TRUE,  FALSE, FALSE, TRUE,  FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE,  TRUE
`a widow pensioner`                                     MEANS `A person in a contribution period, for section 335` OF 2026, FALSE, TRUE,  TRUE,  FALSE, TRUE,  FALSE, TRUE,  FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE,  TRUE

-- An employee insured in every Chapter pays all nine (row IL-07's convention, now from the text).
#ASSERT `s 335 — the branches for which contributions are payable, for` `a resident employee insured in every Chapter` EQUALS `the branches of insurance, in the order of Schedule J`
-- (e), (f): a controlling shareholder in a closely-held company pays neither unemployment nor insolvency.
#ASSERT `s 335 — the branches for which contributions are payable, for` `a controlling shareholder in a closely-held company` EQUALS LIST `maternity`, `children`, `work injury`, `accident injury`, `disability`, `long-term care`, `senior citizens and survivors`
-- (a), (c): a non-resident employee insured for work injury only: maternity and work injury.
#ASSERT `s 335 — the branches for which contributions are payable, for` `a non-resident employee insured under Chapter 5 only` EQUALS LIST `maternity`, `work injury`
-- (b), (i): a housewife insured under Chapter 11 pays neither children nor senior citizens and
-- survivors, and (i) gives her no maternity; she pays the Chapters she is insured under.
#ASSERT `s 335 — the branches for which contributions are payable, for` `a housewife` EQUALS LIST `accident injury`, `disability`, `long-term care`
-- (i) excludes a widow pensioner; (b), which follows s 65(a)(1), excludes only a housewife.
#ASSERT `s 335 — the branches for which contributions are payable, for` `a widow pensioner` EQUALS LIST `children`, `accident injury`, `disability`, `long-term care`
-- Before 2026: declined.
#ASSERT REFUSED `s 335 — the branches for which contributions are payable, for` (`A person in a contribution period, for section 335` OF 2025, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE) BECAUSE "this row answers section 335 for contribution periods from January 2026"
